WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.560
more than 300,000 children, little children,

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:06.760
who were trafficked into the United States

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:08.500
on the Biden watch,

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:12.560
many of whom have been raped, exploited, and abused and sold.

